- **Concern**: Finding 4: planned fail-closed CI assertion allows a token-record containing only TOOL=.... Scenario: append-token-record treats any non-empty sidecar as a record and defaults missing numeric fields to zero, so a TOOL-only file would append a misleading codex row instead of proving fail-closed emptiness
